OL,3,GNEWSAJeremy Clarkson farmers' choir to
OL,4,Ago on nationwide tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeremy Clarkson's Hawkstone Farmers'
OL,7,FChoir - which won this year's Britain's
OL,8,FGot Talent (BGT) - has announced a
OL,9,Fnationwide tour.
OL,11,FThe choir was named winner of the ITV
OL,12,Ftalent show in May - describing TV
OL,13,Fpresenter Clarkson as "their biggest
OL,14,Fcheerleader".
OL,16,FThe choir, which includes farmers from
OL,17,Fthe West Country such as Andy Fussell,
OL,18,Fan arable farmer in Rode, near Frome,
OL,19,FSomerset, will perform at venues across
OL,20,Fthe UK in the spring, including the
OL,21,FBath Forum on 31 March 2027.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
