OL,3,GNEWSAJeremy Clarkson farmers' choir to
OL,4,Ago on nationwide tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FFussell, who sings bass, said the group
OL,7,Fwould continue to support five mental
OL,8,Fhealth charities after donating #50,000
OL,9,Fof their BGT prize money, as "everyone
OL,10,Fin the choir has lost someone they know
OL,11,Fto suicide".
